august is upon us which means the summer  is starting to wind down but that  doesn't mean that the game releases are  slowing down here is a list of the  biggest games releasing in august 2022  16 years after the series debut and nine  years after the last numbered entry  saints row is back instead of joining a  gang that has already been established  you'll be making a name for yourself and  building up what will become the  legendary saints however don't think of  this as a prequel to the original game  saints row features a brand new cast of  characters and a new setting santo aliso  a huge and vibrant sandbox in the  american southwest like previous games  in the series saints row's gameplay loop  revolves around seizing territory from  rival gangs like los panteros or martial  defense industries gunplay and traversal  are what you've come to expect from the  series however you'll have a few more  options when it comes to vehicle combat  sainsrow is shooting its way onto ps4  ps5 xbox one series x and s and pc via  the epic game store on august 23rd  in cult of the lamb you play as a  possessed lamb who has been saved from  an untimely death by an ominous stranger  all you have to do in return is build a  loyal following in their name in order  to do this you must explore the randomly  generated world and destroy the  non-believers and false prophets you'll  perform dark rituals give sermons  collect resources to build structures  with and train your loyal flock of  woodland creatures i swear if the art  style were different and it wasn't cute  little animal characters this game would  be so much darker you too can join the  call when this game releases on ps5 xbox  series x and s switch and pc on august  11th  football is back and once again has  managed to improve on last year's game  perhaps the biggest new feature in  madden nfl 23 is the field sense feature  that ea promises will deliver more  control at all positions in every mode  ea said that this new system will help  deliver ultra realistic gameplay  including new animations and player  control mechanics madden nfl 23 also  updates face of the franchise with a new  experience called the league there will  be new position specific mechanics and  player focused cameras franchise mode  meanwhile will offer simplified team  building mechanics in terms of visuals  madden nfl 23 aims to offer a new level  of visual realism in all stages of the  football experience there will be new  player locked 4k touchdown cameras that  aim to match with the latest nfl tv  broadcast offer you can continue to  secretly pretend you're tom brady when  madden nfl 23 drops on august 19th for  pc and every console except switch  do you think rocket league is cool but  you consider yourself more of a golfer  well turbo golf racing is perfect for  you in turbo golf racing courses are a  mix of golf links and race tracks and it  looks like getting your ball into the  green and into the hole will be a matter  of speed and positioning as much as  finesse and aim a key difference from  rocket league is that turbo golf racing  puts more emphasis on the race to get  the ball where it belongs rather than  the full contact wallops of squaring off  against another team hit the links in an  all-new way when turbo golf racing comes  to xbox one series x and s and pc on  august 4. so you remember two point  hospital and all the lives that you  ruined by not hiring enough staff to  help patients well what if i told you  you could ruin the lives of confused  young adults instead sounds fun right in  two point campus you can build the  university of your dreams and pack it  with crazy courses and the best staff  that money can buy for some college is  considered the best years of their lives  so it's up to you to make sure that  these students work hard and play harder  or the other way around if that's how  you get down two point canvas is  registering for classes on august 9th  for every console and pc  rumbleverse may have missed its initial  february release date but now it's ready  to put your free time in a headlock  rumbleverse is a 40 player free to play  battle royale where you'll take on the  role of custom made pro wrestlers  fighting across grapple city the city  name alone is enough to make me want to  give this game a shot during a match you  can find weapons like bats and folding  chairs as well as climb skyscrapers  across the city and perform high impact  moves like suplexes and power bombs from  the top of the building onto the streets  below get ready to slam your way to  victory when rumbleverse comes to pc and  every console except switch on august  11. the game's first season will begin a  week later on august 18th  first released on ps4 in 2018 and  remastered for ps5 in 2020 marvel  spider-man is now swinging onto pcs for  2022 in the game you play as spider-man  of course fighting crime and keeping the  streets of new york safe from iconic  spidey villains but you'll also get to  take off the suit and experience peter's  struggles to balance his personal life  and career while the fate of the city  rests on his shoulders i hope you're  ready to fall in love with mary jane  because marvel spider-man is headed to  pc on august 12th  roller drum is what you get when you  take skating tricks high scores and a  bunch of guns and mix them all together  in a pod coming from the developer of  aliali world roller drum trades  skateboards for roller skates and side  scrolling courses for 3d arenas the big  twist is that you're not alone in these  arenas they're filled with enemies  called house players whose goal is to  murder you roller drum is a blood sport  in which your objective in each level is  to kill all the house players before  they can kill you and to look awesome  doing it clearing enemies can also help  you maximize your score because as you  take out the opposition you gain  multipliers that increase the points you  earn from landing tricks you can skate  and shoot your way to victory when  roller drum releases for ps4 ps5 and pc  on august 16th  developed by mostly a one-man team and  published by humble games midnight fight  express is an isometric 3d brawler that  features non-stop over-the-top action in  the game you play as a former member of  the criminal underworld that is lured  back into your violent ways by a  mysterious drone however there's a good  reason you have until sunset to stop a  city-wide criminal takeover to do this  you'll take on waves of enemies across  41 handcrafted levels using your fists  along with knives guns toilet plungers  and more you can see if you have what it  takes to save the city when midnight  fight express drops on august 23rd for  ps4 xbox one switch and pc  behind every great racer is a great  manager in f1 manager 2022 you're the  boss which means it's up to you to pick  a great roster of drivers and staff to  help lead you to some w's keep your  finances in check monitor the  performance of your drivers plot how you  can steal staff from your rival teams  and more f1 manager 2022 is crossing the  finish line on august 25th for pc and  every console except switch  soul hackers 2 is the follow-up to demon  summoner soul hackers itself a sci-fi  spin-off in the shin megami tensei  franchise set in the same world as soul  hackers without continuing that tale you  play as ringo a character created by a  sentient artificial intelligence and  dispatch to stop some coming event from  ending the world with soul hackers 2  you're dealing with a group of  characters who are older rather than  those who are making their way through  high school but this is also a  supernatural sci-fi rpg so expect some  fantastical elements for instance there  are demons and you can summon them  according to atlas while the first soul  hackers had a pretty hardcore rpg ben  that might have turned off some players  the sequel is looking to be a little  more welcoming while also seemingly  borrowing a lot of what worked from  recent successes like persona 5 to  present a new story you can summon some  demons when soul hackers 2 comes to pc  and every console except switch on  august 25th  so which of these games are you most  interested in are there any that you  can't wait to play that didn't make this  list let us know in the comments and  stay tuned to gamespot for more  [Music]  you
 

